WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.416
A translated document still has to be checked before anyone sends it.

2
00:00:07.033 --> 00:00:11.300
Drop in a meeting note, and Passage translates it here on this machine.

3
00:00:11.550 --> 00:00:15.859
Every paragraph and every table cell comes back as its own row.

4
00:00:16.367 --> 00:00:19.098
Each row is named for where it sits in the file.

5
00:00:19.348 --> 00:00:23.657
Paragraph five is a link, and it came back exactly as it went in.

6
00:00:27.119 --> 00:00:30.618
Disagree with a line, and you rewrite it here, then approve it.

7
00:00:30.868 --> 00:00:34.558
Your wording is what ends up in the document, not the model's.

8
00:00:40.915 --> 00:00:44.734
Download it, and the edit is in the file, with the link untouched.

9
00:00:45.239 --> 00:00:47.884
Passage. Read what it wrote before you send it.
